  "readings": [
    {
      "hash": "#chapter-7",
      "images": 40,
      "broken": [],
      "overflow": false,
      "balloons": [
        {
          "panel": "N7-01",
          "text": "Two mornings later. Ninth round complete.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N7-01",
          "text": "Give Kiva my morning.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N7-03",
          "text": "Daro brought the packing stock up. His cart is below.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N7-03",
          "text": "DaroI would rather earn something on the way back.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N7-04",
          "text": "KivaThis set is Rusk\u2019s. The buyer\u2019s is still in the jig.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N7-05",
          "text": "I thought I was taking it to Rusk.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N7-05",
          "text": "KivaYou are collecting it for me. We have not agreed the rest yet.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N7-06",
          "text": "Rusk asked for the rear yard today. His long frame is in the front aisle.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N7-06",
          "text": "DaroYou bring the box to the landing. I take the cart leg; her board comes back with you.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N7-07",
          "text": "DaroThe cart cannot climb these steps. From that landing, the ramp goes round to his yard.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N7-08",
          "text": "Aren collects. Daro may carry it from the landing to Rusk.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N7-08",
          "text": "KivaIf he cannot receive it, bring it back. No doorstep drop.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N7-09",
          "text": "My usual cart share, when Rusk\u2019s receipt comes back.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N7-09",
          "text": "KivaThe rest of the collection fee is yours, Aren. Agreed?",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N7-09",
          "text": "ArenAgreed.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N7-10",
          "text": "KivaHis slip comes back. The hinges stay with him.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N7-11",
          "text": "One box to Rusk. The board back here.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N7-13",
          "text": "Use the outside turn. The inside catches the board.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N7-15",
          "text": "Here. No tilt over the wheel.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N7-16",
          "text": "It is yours to carry now.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N7-16",
          "text": "DaroTo Rusk. Or back to Kiva.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N7-18",
          "text": "I could come down with you.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N7-19",
          "text": "You can. It will still be my load.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N7-20",
          "text": "I will take this back.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N7-22",
          "text": "Rusk. Kiva\u2019s set.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N7-23",
          "text": "Put it here, out of the shavings.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N7-24",
          "text": "Good. I can fit these when the frame is out.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N7-25",
          "text": "Tell her I have the set.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N7-26",
          "text": "That is the piece I was waiting for.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N7-27",
          "text": "I keep thinking I should be there.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N7-28",
          "text": "You brought this back. I can keep working.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N7-28",
          "text": "KivaLet him finish his part.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N7-31",
          "text": "Rusk has the set.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N7-31",
          "text": "KivaThank you. Both of you.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N7-32",
          "text": "Your cart share.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N7-33",
          "text": "And the collection.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N7-34",
          "text": "Next time, I will ask you before I plan the stairs.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N7-34",
          "text": "DaroTell me the landing. I will tell you when I can be there.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N7-35",
          "text": "East washhouse asked for first-bell collection next market day.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N7-36",
          "text": "That is my morning round.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N7-36",
          "text": "DaroAnd I have not walked the collection door they marked.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N7-37",
          "text": "We speak to the person handing goods over before either of us promises.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N7-37",
          "text": "DaroTomorrow after your round. Meet here.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N7-38",
          "text": "Later, in his own room.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N7-38",
          "text": "How was the collection?",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N7-39",
          "text": "I only carried it halfway.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N7-39",
          "text": "SeraDid it arrive?",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N7-39",
          "text": "ArenYes.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N7-40",
          "text": "Will you walk to the east washhouse with us after tomorrow\u2019s round?",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        },
        {
          "panel": "N7-40",
          "text": "SeraYes. With the person handing the goods over.",
          "font": "16px",
          "inside": true
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "snapshot_sha256": "5ac1f9fa1020f548af8f699ed6a0a7773a8ebacf9a90d2b255c5363de09fe889"
}
